ike_count": 0}, {"author": "marce_mpv", "author_id": "29668984213", "id": "18446947417126773", "text": "Grandes MK ULTRA'S, porque igual la élite las hubieran puesto en donde estan", "timestamp": 1791237041, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "andresfabiansuarez", "author_id": "46289139", "id": "17909698263516348", "text": "Alter ego", "timestamp": 1791050917, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "timmyfunkam", "author_id": "78818801448", "id": "18096332120389692", "text": "Soy TimmyFunk, bailarín, profesor y coreógrafo de danza", "timestamp": 1790975828, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kalev7u7", "author_id": "76493445465", "id": "17910614982520396", "text": "Genial, ahora tengo síndrome de protagonista 😃", "timestamp": 1790840795, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "imperial___nubia", "author_id": "77212508132", "id": "18632010601036265", "text": "Mi alter ego: NUBIA AURELIA VALMONT LECLAIR\nPoderosa.\nRadiante.\nEterna.\nUna presencia que no pide permiso.\nUna luz que no necesita explicación.\nUn legado que trasciende el tiempo.\nElegancia. Poder. Eternidad.\nMi identidad crea mi destino.\nMi imperio comienza dentro. 👑✨", "timestamp": 1790819798, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "paralelaloves", "author_id": "652642347", "id": "18110020199611587", "text": "No lo recomiendo, el alter ego es del bajo astral y termina dominandote, el doble cuántico te ayuda ❤️", "timestamp": 1790805415, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "non_registered0", "author_id": "7526835885", "id": "17988921233865260", "text": "\"Shakira\" es su nombre REAL, mijo, investiga antes de hablar se llama Shakira Isabel.", "timestamp": 1790752845, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "corruptshadow7", "author_id": "65853641298", "id": "18085668275317570", "text": "No sé trata de alter ego, se trata de crear un trastorno de personalidad múltiple, el verdadero prime es el que da lo mejor de ti sin reprimir ni amplificar nada de manera forzada", "timestamp": 1790719823, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gg5d03t", "author_id": "29119856223", "id": "18103641122348174", "text": "Cuál es tu alter ego  Ale?", "timestamp": 1790716806, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sawstorm", "author_id": "4767983547", "id": "17982583053109291", "text": "Acabas de crear cientos de Therian's con este vídeo", "timestamp": 1790605514, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "camielevp22__", "author_id": "71915866861", "id": "17949763251050012", "text": "Yo tengo uno el tipo se llama Brian era un periodista tímido, raro y introvertido que pasó de convirtió en Marilyn Manson:33", "timestamp": 1790561860, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mist.eriosocultos2", "author_id": "34607314132", "id": "18013471529969594", "text": "Kraven of Hunter", "timestamp": 1790561517, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "flaco_cgl", "author_id": "72086343261", "id": "18072138779739618", "text": "El flaco", "timestamp": 1790552174, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dcr5r-aT_oz/?stkn=amhweGEzN3oycm04", "webpage_url_basename": "Dcr5r-aT_oz", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/789925056_18622162618041711_3123396078963419430_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=Mzk3NTUyNDgwNjY4NjY2OTM2MzE4NjIyMTYyNjA5MDQxNzEx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=Kbs4984QGTYQ7kNvwEokJQy&_nc_oc=AdpmI0YeNNaYHeHuRW-aL-hJbRlIEHlkJnCGXQ1eUeN05kgMjw02yFmWqKOZEIWRqoY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=5PngODeBwEbI1Yc8vBHa4g&_nc_ss=7ba8c&oh=00_AQPGsAEStDwOMSW1f3v2Zv3uezH84vy3J4rUM6Jsjyd25Q&oe=6ACDC8DE", "display_id": "Dcr5r-aT_oz", "fulltitle": "Video by paco.benitez", "upload_date": "20260831", "epoch": 1791484954, "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPWfKQyqGY0s2rSIJ1mq_3F9CYdTwIPl6gDMrW-IMLvoaYHgCfbal8cSd0BnIjaq3GipRPotnPJ8F_nrQNORxacpZ4UWrGv-s6cNes.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht